---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Sponsorship from '../components/Sponsorship.astro';
import Seo from '../components/Seo.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { partnersSchema } from '../lib/seo';
import { partnersTitle, partnersDescription } from '../lib/pages';
import { guestPortraits } from '../lib/guest-portraits';
import { communities, episodes, guests } from '../data';
import '@fontsource-variable/fredoka';
import '@fontsource-variable/space-grotesk';
import '@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css';
import '../styles/global.css';
import '../styles/about.css';

const title = partnersTitle;
const description = partnersDescription;
const portraits = await guestPortraits();
const schema = partnersSchema(title,description,portraits.map(guest=>({...guest,image:guest.portrait.src})));
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#15101d" />
    <Seo {title} {description} path="/partners/" {schema} markdown="/partners/index.md" />
  </head>
  <body class="about-page">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div id="top"></div>
    <div class="about-opening">
      <Header active="partners" />
      <main id="main">
        <section class="about-intro wrap" aria-labelledby="about-title">
          <div class="about-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">PARTNERS <span class="about-divider">/</span> WORK WITH CR2</p>
            <h1 id="about-title">Put your brand<br />in the <em>front row.</em></h1>
            <p class="about-dek">CR2 is independent media for crypto, finance and tech. Our flagship show, <strong>Chill with R2</strong>, goes live every Tuesday and Thursday with the founders and builders shaping Robinhood Chain. Partner with us to reach the people who build and invest.</p>
            <div class="sponsor-hero-actions">
              <a class="about-primary sponsor-cta" href="#sponsor">Become a partner <Arrow direction="south" /></a>
              <a class="text-link" href="#audience">See the audience <Arrow direction="south" /></a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="host-board" aria-label="Live reach on StreamYard">
            <div class="host-board-heading"><span>PROOF</span><img src="/assets/studio-mark.svg" width="62" height="56" alt="" /></div>
            <div class="proof-lead">
              <strong>Top 1%</strong>
              <p>of StreamYard streamers</p>
            </div>
            <div class="proof-stats">
              <div>
                <strong>55,258</strong>
                <p>viewer minutes<small>One stream, on X</small></p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <strong>6</strong>
                <p>live streams<small>November 2026</small></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <p class="host-board-footer proof-source">Source: StreamYard, Nov 2026</p>
          </aside>
        </section>
        <section class="reach-strip" aria-labelledby="reach-title">
          <div class="wrap">
            <p class="reach-label" id="reach-title">NOVEMBER 2026 SNAPSHOT</p>
            <div class="reach-strip-inner">
              <div class="reach-stat"><strong>600k<span>+</span></strong><p>X views on CR2 posts<small>@chillwithr2, @R2D2zen and @ripchillpill · Sep to Nov 2026</small></p></div>
              <div class="reach-stat"><strong>20k<span>+</span></strong><p>Livestream views<small>X replay totals, Ep 01 to 11 · as of 16 Nov</small></p></div>
              <div class="reach-stat"><strong>{episodes.length}</strong><p>Live episodes<small>Since 6 Oct 2026 · Tue &amp; Thu, 15:00 UTC</small></p></div>
              <div class="reach-stat"><strong>{guests.length}</strong><p>Guests on air<small>Founders, builders, investors and creators</small></p></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="why-section wrap" aria-labelledby="why-title">
          <div class="about-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">WHY PARTNER WITH CR2</p><h2 id="why-title">A live room for<br />crypto’s builders.</h2><p>Partners sit inside the conversation, not around it: live shows, recurring segments and clips shared across the hosts’ accounts and CR2’s communities.</p></div>
          <div class="why-grid">
            <article class="why-card"><span class="why-num">01</span><h3>A focused audience</h3><p>Founders, high-net-worth investors, technologists and finance professionals following Robinhood Chain and onchain markets.</p></article>
            <article class="why-card"><span class="why-num">02</span><h3>Live twice a week, posting five</h3><p>Tuesday and Thursday livestreams, plus posts five days a week across CR2 and both hosts. Every livestream stays up as a replay.</p></article>
            <article class="why-card"><span class="why-num">03</span><h3>Distribution beyond the show</h3><p>Episodes and clips go out on @chillwithr2 and both hosts’ accounts, and into CR2’s communities: 7,500+ memberships.</p></article>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="formats-section" id="formats" aria-labelledby="formats-title">
          <div class="wrap">
            <div class="about-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FORMATS</p><h2 id="formats-title">Where your brand shows up.</h2><p>Every format is hosted by Chill Pill and R2D2.</p></div>
            <div class="format-grid">
              <article class="format-card violet"><p class="format-when">TUE + THU · 15:00 UTC</p><h3>Chill with R2 livestream</h3><p>The flagship show, live with guests from across crypto, finance and tech. About 90 minutes, with a full replay after.</p><p class="format-meta">Recurring segments: The Golden Ratio · In the Hood</p></article>
              <article class="format-card green"><p class="format-when">ON AIR</p><h3>Live product testing</h3><p>We use your product live on the show: hands-on testing, real usage and honest feedback for your team.</p></article>
              <article class="format-card pink"><p class="format-when">EVERY EPISODE</p><h3>Clips and posts</h3><p>Highlights and episode posts across @chillwithr2, @R2D2zen and @ripchillpill.</p></article>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="audience-section wrap" id="audience" aria-labelledby="audience-title">
          <div class="about-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">AUDIENCE &amp; REACH</p><h2 id="audience-title">People who build.<br />People who invest.</h2><p>Founders, high-net-worth investors, technologists and finance professionals. A focused audience for brands working in crypto, finance and tech.</p></div>
          <div class="audience-grid">
            <div class="geography">
              <h3>A global audience.</h3>
              <p>The US and UK lead, with viewers across developed and emerging markets.</p>
              <div class="geo-strip" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
              <dl class="geo-key"><div><dt><i aria-hidden="true"></i>United States</dt><dd>28%</dd></div><div><dt><i aria-hidden="true"></i>United Kingdom</dt><dd>8%</dd></div><div><dt><i aria-hidden="true"></i>Rest of the world</dt><dd>64%</dd></div></dl>
            </div>
            <div class="distribution">
              <div class="distribution-heading"><h3>Beyond the broadcast.</h3><span><b>7,500+</b> community memberships</span></div>
              <p>Every show and clip is shared across CR2’s communities.</p>
              <dl class="community-list">{communities.map(community => <div><dt>{community.name}</dt><dd>{community.count}<small>{community.label}</small></dd></div>)}</dl>
              <p class="about-note">Combined published sizes of the first four communities; memberships may overlap. MHH Colony is additional.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="guest-section" id="guests" aria-labelledby="guests-title">
          <div class="wrap">
            <div class="guest-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE CONVERSATIONS</p><h2 id="guests-title">Who’s been on CR2.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/episodes/">Watch the show <Arrow /></a></div>
            <div class="guest-grid">{portraits.map(guest => (
              <a class="guest" aria-label={guest.name + ' on X'} href={'https://x.com/' + guest.handle} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
                <span class="guest-portrait"><img src={guest.portrait.src} width="256" height="256" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt={guest.name + "’s X profile avatar"} /></span>
                <span class="guest-content"><span class="guest-name">{guest.name}<Arrow /></span><span class="guest-role">{guest.role}</span><span class="guest-handle">@{guest.handle}</span></span>
              </a>
            ))}</div>
            <p class="about-note guest-note">¹ Zona won the Open Category at the Arbitrum × Robinhood Chain Open House buildathon, which drew 1,200+ builders.</p>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="partner-steps wrap" aria-labelledby="partner-title">
          <div class="about-section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">HOW TO PARTNER</p><h2 id="partner-title">Three steps to go live.</h2><p>Chill with R2 is currently powered by Mosh. Tell us what you want to achieve and we’ll shape the partnership with you.</p></div>
          <ol class="step-list">
            <li><span>01</span><h3>Send an enquiry</h3><p>Use the form below: who you are, who you want to reach, and what you have in mind.</p></li>
            <li><span>02</span><h3>Shape the fit</h3><p>We talk through formats, segments, timing and posts together.</p></li>
            <li><span>03</span><h3>Go live</h3><p>Your brand joins the show live, in front of the CR2 audience.</p></li>
          </ol>
          <a class="about-primary sponsor-cta" href="#sponsor">Start the conversation <Arrow direction="south" /></a>
        </section>
        <Sponsorship inline />
        <div class="wrap metrics-notes">
          <details>
            <summary>About the numbers <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
            <div><p>November 2026 snapshot. X views on CR2 posts are the combined public X view counts on CR2-related posts from @chillwithr2, @R2D2zen and @ripchillpill, September to November 2026, as supplied by CR2 (a 16 November pull counted 512,863 excluding reposts and 646,527 including them). They are cumulative views, not unique viewers. Livestream views are the X replay view totals for Episodes 01 to 11 as of 16 November (20,198); they count live and replay views, not unique viewers. Audience geography is supplied by CR2.</p><p>Top 1% of StreamYard streamers is StreamYard’s ranking of users who broadcast in the last 30 days, as shown in StreamYard in November 2026. 55,258 viewer minutes is the total for one stream on X. 6 live streams is the November 2026 count in StreamYard. Guest roles reflect the supplied guest list and guests’ own X bios. Community sizes are reported memberships and subscriptions, not deduplicated people.</p></div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <footer class="footer wrap"><div class="footer-brand">CR2<span>© 2026</span></div><p>Powered by <a href="https://x.com/Moshdottrade" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Mosh <Arrow /></a><small>CR2 is not affiliated with Robinhood Markets, Inc.</small></p><a class="back-top" href="#top" aria-label="Back to top"><Arrow direction="north" /></a></footer>
  </body>
</html>
